      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im 72 and i had a weird moment earlier. i stood up from the couch and everything just went black for a second, i felt super lightheaded and basically blacked out. i think im just dehydrated or something because it's been hot lately. should i just drink a ton of water and rest it off or do i need to worry?",
