      "content": "oh wow okay. i'm a bit scared now. but the er is so expensive and i have a lot of doctor visits already. is there anything else i can take at home right now to stabilize my heart rate or blood pressure so i can just sleep it off instead of going in? maybe some aspirin or something?",
